textbook page span       chapter count             39  0.7277        strong     

Interpretation for Chapter 7: a strong positive rho between an INDEPENDENT measure of textbook
coverage and the planner's output is evidence that instructional volume is derived from curricular
emphasis. Note honestly that distinct-pages is only quasi-independent (it comes from the same
retrieval call, though not from any quantity the planner consumes), which is exactly why the
manual page count is worth collecting.

